==History==
===Background===
After the destruction of [[Incursia]] caused by [[Ascalon]],<ref name="SA">''[[Solitary Alignment]]''</ref> [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] began to dedicate himself to peaceful sciences, eventually creating the Omnitrix, hoping to create a means for the races of the [[Milky Way (Classic)|galaxy]] to live in harmony. He used the Omnitrix's Collect Mode to gather the DNA of thousands of species over hundreds of years.{{Refn|[[:File:Azmuth Collect Mode.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref>''[[Benwolf|Benwolf]]''</ref>

After the Omnitrix was created, Azmuth sent [[Xylene]] to take it to [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] and deliver it to [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]],{{Refn|In ''[[The Visitor]]'', it was revealed that [[Xylene]] sent the Omnitrix to [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]]. In '''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix|Secret of the Omnitrix]]''''', [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] implied that he did not have anyone in mind to wield the Omnitrix. However, in ''[[The Final Battle: Part 2]]'', it is revealed that Azmuth intended for Max to wield the Omnitrix.{{Refn|name=retcon|group=BTP}}|group = note}} as he considered him the greatest [[Plumbers (Classic)|plumber]] in the galaxy.<ref name="TFB2"/>

===Ben 10===
In ''[[And Then There Were 10]]'', while Xylene was carrying the Omnitrix aboard [[Xylene's Ship|her ship]], [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] attacked her, seeking the device, causing Xylene to make the choice to jettison it. With the pressure of being attacked, she programmed the [[Omnitrix Containment Pod (Classic)|Omnitrix's containment pod]] to hone in on Max's DNA signature,{{Refn|[[:File:Wrong Tennyson Found.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="ATTWT"/> though it accidentally missed his exact location and the Omnitrix's containment pod was sent to the nearby forest thanks to the timely intervention of [[Professor Paradox]] and [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]].<ref>''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref> It nearly hit Max's grandson, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]], and with him being a close enough genetic match to Max, it leaped up and secured itself to Ben's wrist.<ref name="Azmuth"/><ref name="TFB2"/>{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Jump at Ben.png]]|group=pop-up}}<ref name="ATTWT"/> Since then, Ben has been using the Omnitrix to be a hero.

Azmuth had observed all of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s activities through secret devices on the Omnitrix well before he met him.{{Refn|[[:File:Azmuth Stalker.png]]|group = pop-up|name = observe}}<ref name="SotO"/>{{Refn|[[:File:Azmuth can observe Ben.png]]|group = pop-up|name = ob}}{{Refn|group = DVD|name=AGEB}}

In '''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens|Destroy All Aliens]]''' as Ben was using Upgrade against the Urban Assault Vehicle, Gwen unknowingly caused the Omnitrix to malfunction resulting in Azmuth turning into a evil Way Big and briefly trapping them alongside Azmuth's father and Tetrax.

Sometime after the flashbacks in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Ben decided to remove the Omnitrix and live a normal life.<ref name="B10R1"/>

===Alien Force===
In ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]'', after Max disappeared, Ben decided to put on the Omnitrix again to face the threat of the [[Highbreed]] and find his grandfather. When he tried to use the Omnitrix after years, the device adapted to Ben's current state,{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/2/23/Hero_Generation_Series_Bible.pdf Hero Generation Series Bible]|name = HG|group=HG Bible}} reconfiguring itself to provide him with new aliens and a new appearance.

[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 1|Some time after the defeat of the Highbreed]], Vilgax came to Earth and killed Ben as [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]] in a duel, but the Omnitrix resurrected him as [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]] bonded with Chromastone's remains.{{Refn|group=AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}

[[The Final Battle: Part 1|A while later]], [[Albedo]] partnered with Vilgax and kidnapped [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]]. Holding them hostage, Vilgax forced Ben to hand over the Omnitrix or he would kill them. Without hesitating, Ben gave it to Vilgax, who began its usage on his [[Bioid]]s. When Ben and his friends invaded Vilgax's [[Vilgax's Ship (Alien Force)|ship]], Ben activated the Omnitrix's voice command to activate its self-destruction mode to threaten the villain into returning the device, but Vilgax didn't believe his threats and the Omnitrix ended up destroyed.

==Purpose==
The Omnitrix was created by [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] as a tool of peace in an act of repentance following the destruction caused by his previous creation, [[Ascalon]], a weapon of terrible power.<ref name="SA"/>

To the rest of the universe, the Omnitrix had a two-fold purpose. One was to promote inter-species understanding by allowing other beings to experience different ways of life.<ref name="SotO"/> The other was to function as a repository for the DNA of over a million different species that Azmuth thought were intelligent.{{Refn|[[:File:Species in the Omnitrix.PNG]]|group=DM}} The samples were scanned, and when necessary, repaired.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Sampling Process.png]]|group=DM}} This collection of DNA was then preserved in the event that any of the species catalogued were rendered extinct, allowing the Omnitrix to restore them to life.<ref name="WotW1">''[[War of the Worlds: Part 1]]''</ref>

Unbeknownst to everyone else, Azmuth had a third reason for creating the Omnitrix. He hoped that his estranged lover [[Zennith]], who had left him as he created Ascalon, would learn of his change and come back to him.<ref name="SA"/>

