{{Quote|When you're close, set the Omnitrix to Capture Mode, and then it'll do the rest.<br>The yellow setting!|[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]].<ref name="VoV2"/>}}
When a new DNA sample has been unlocked from the [[Codon Stream]], or when the Omnitrix captures new DNA not present in the Codon Stream, Collect Mode is activated.{{Refn|name=halloween|group=DM}}{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Bonded With Ben.png]]|name=bonded|group=DM}} It can also reclaim lost<ref name="VoV2"/> or removed alien DNA that was in the Codon Stream.<ref name="GhT"/>

It scans to match the species, then moves the identified species to the active playlist. If it seen the species before, it does it passively, without Ben actively scanning.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix and Ultimatrix Capture Mode.PNG]]|group=DM}}

Unlike in the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', the Omnitrix in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' would not scan by touch (due to its reconfiguration).

The Omnitrix could scan [[Kevin's Mutations|Kevin's mutations]], but it was programmed not to.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix and Ultimatrix Could Scan Kevin's Mutations.PNG]]|group=DM}}

