*The Omnitrix mainly allowed for the user to transform into a numerous variety of alien life-forms, each with their own unique powers and abilities (along with their weaknesses) and in a selection of alien DNA that is in groups of 10.<ref name="WotW1"/>
*The Omnitrix automatically reverted the user back into their normal form when they got sufficiently hurt or knocked out.<ref name="WotW1"/>
*The Omnitrix acted as a wireless receiver for the [[Codon Stream]].<ref name="Primus">''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]''</ref>
