**Ben's DNA was stored in the Omnitrix itself instead of the Codon Stream.{{Refn|group=DM|name=bonded}}
*The Omnitrix had a quick change feature.
**The user could change back by turning the second ring on the dial to the 3 o'clock position. When [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] appeared to be changing mentally, it was just a coincidence. He was out of time and changing anyway.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Revert.PNG]]|group=DM}}
**Manually touching the Omnitrix symbol not only allows the user to immediately transform back to normal<ref name="AT">''[[Alone Together]]''</ref> but can also be used to change forms while already transformed.<ref name="GCBC">''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix could alter its size to fit the user's wrist.<ref name="TFB2"/>
*The Omnitrix emits a frequency when in use,<ref name=Vilgax/><ref name="BWaV"/> so the user can easily be tracked using it.<ref>''[[The Alliance]]''</ref><ref name="Secrets"/>
*Once placed on a host, the Omnitrix utilizes the host's DNA and melds with their skin at the genetic level, thereby making it impossible to remove by any normal physical means.<ref name="BWaV"/>
*The Omnitrix can open its panel and show its circuits, thus distributing its energy to another device or individual.<ref name="S1">''[[Showdown: Part 1]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix could show a database image of all aliens unlocked.<ref name="VoV2"/>
*The Omnitrix was able to repair genetic damage, such as turn DNAliens back to normal and remove [[Xenocite]]s.<ref name="MO">''[[Max Out]]''</ref> However, doing this act for an extended period on multiple targets results in the device using up a lot of power, shortening how long the user can stay transformed.
*The Omnitrix could genetically manipulate DNA or reprogram a species' DNA (like fuse DNA from different species of aliens).<ref name="WotW2"/>
*The Omnitrix had a scratch guard that Ben did not know how to remove, though it fell off after '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]'''''.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Scratch Guard.png]]|group=DJW|name=scratch}}
*The Omnitrix changed the aliens' eye color to match the device's core color.<ref name="B10R1"/><ref>''[[And Then There Were None]]''</ref> 
*The Omnitrix could be synchronized with another Omnitrix, even without the user's intent.<ref>[[Professor Paradox]]</ref><ref name="BA">''[[Ben Again]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix was waterproof.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix and Ultimatrix Waterproof.PNG]]|group=DM}}
*The Omnitrix had a Master Control mode.<ref name="BWaV"/><ref name="WotW1"/>
**It allows unlimited access to all of the Omnitrix's functions like access to all alien forms in the device and also, instant changes with no time limit unless all available power is used up.{{Refn|[[:File:Halloween Trio Sampled.PNG]]|name=halloween|group=DM}}
**It can be unlocked via a special code,<ref name="BWaV"/> or voice command by [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]].<ref name="WoW1">''[[War of the Worlds: Part 1]]''</ref>
**Ben could unlock the Master Control via Voice Command, but he'd have to unlock it manually first.{{Refn|group=DM|name = link unavailable}}
*The Omnitrix could replace one of its DNA samples with someone else from the same species.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix and Ultimatrix Could Replace DNA Samples.PNG]]|group=DM}}
*The Omnitrix was able to be set to prevent the user from returning to their base form. It can be reconfigured by putting the user into a transformational loop until it is deactivated.<ref name="DAA"/> 
*In its reconfigured state, the Omnitrix granted the user full understanding of the aliens' powers upon transforming into them.{{Refn|[[:File:Kevin's Original Car.PNG]]|group=DM|name=shouting}} However, this is inconsistent, as Ben had to be educated on the rules of [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]]'s powers<ref name="XB2">''[[X = Ben + 2]]''</ref> and was unaware that [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]] could fly.<ref name="TSC"/>
*The Omnitrix had the ability to redirect scans from inorganic aliens if the power was boosted, resulting in an orange rippling pulse to come out of the Omnitrix, sending anyone near it flying backwards.<ref name="AS">'''''[[Ben 10: Alien Swarm]]'''''</ref>
*The Omnitrix could create an alien species, as with the case of [[Nanomech]].<ref name="AS"/>

