*The Omnitrix had AI (Artificial Intelligence).
*The Omnitrix functioned as a GPS.<ref name="VoV2"/><ref name="TFB1">''[[The Final Battle: Part 1]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix could create a hologram map, which is similar to the one in [[Plumber Badge]]s.<ref name="TFB1"/>
*The Omnitrix had a 2-way communication system with Plumber Badges.
*The Omnitrix had a built-in [[Universal Translator]] and could also translate other Earth languages,{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix and Ultimatrix Could Translate Earth Languages.PNG]]|group=DM}} but not animal languages.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix and Ultimatrix Cannot Translate Animal Languages.png]]|group=DM}}
*The Omnitrix could teleport the user through Azmuth's teleportation channel.<ref name="Primus"/>
*The Omnitrix had a homing beacon that could guide the user to [[Xenon]] if it was ever in the planet's quadrant.<ref name="SotO"/>
**Once within a close enough range of Xenon, the Omnitrix could fire a beam of green energy that negates the effects of the planet's light-absorbing device.<ref name="SotO"/>
*The Omnitrix is capable of creating a simulation within itself and transport the user's mind,<ref name="MO"/> including mimicking the home worlds of its DNA samples and displays information on a holographic screen.<ref name="DAA"/>
*The Omnitrix can add extras to lifeforms to make them safer and more usable, such as [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]]'s [[Anti-Gravity Projector (Classic)|Anti-Gravity Projector]].
*The Omnitrix can flag tampering attempts.<ref>''[[Perfect Day]]''</ref>
*If necessary the Omnitrix is capable of Muscular Puppeting.<ref>''[[Singlehanded]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix can levitate.<ref name="BWaV"/>
*The Omnitrix had defense mechanisms to protect the host: 
**The Omnitrix had a built-in energy feedback blast to defend against anyone trying to force it off of its owner.<ref name="Secrets">''[[Secrets]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Built-In Energy Feedback.png]]|group=pop-up}}<ref name="K11"/>{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix energy feedback blast.png]]|group=pop-up}}{{Refn|group=DVD|name=XRBD|''[[X-Ray Ben & Diamondhead V.2]]'', X-Ray Ben Top Secret File}}
**The Omnitrix was capable of monitoring the telemetry of the host's vitals. This allowed it to detect when the host was in danger and self-activate, even in recharge mode.<ref name="GM"/><ref name="GhO"/>
*When transformed, the Omnitrix protected the user from negative effects, including:
**Being possessed by an [[Ectonurite (Classic)|Ectonurite]].<ref name="GhO"/>
**Exposure to the dangerous effects of [[Corrodium]].<ref>''[[Under Wraps]]''</ref>
**Being transformed by [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]]'s mutant ray.<ref name=":0">''[[Dr. Animo and the Mutant Ray]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix has secret devices that give Azmuth the ability to observe the user's actions.{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = observe}}<ref name="SotO"/>{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = ob}}{{Refn|group = DVD|name=AGEB}}

===Non-Canon Functions===
[[File:Omnitrix crystal.png|thumb|Omnitrix Crystal Compatibility]]

*[[Omnitrix Crystal|Omnitrix Crystals]] are energy crystals that appear in [[Ben 10: Protector of Earth]] capable of unlocking lost transformations in the Omnitrix. Is absorbed when the Omnitrix is close in proximity with the crystal.

===Color Coding===
*The Omnitrix could display ten colors, each meaning something different:
**Green: Active Mode
**Red: Recharge Mode
**Yellow: Collect/Capture Mode
**Blue: Reconfiguration Mode
**Purple: Controlled or risk of temporal threat
**Orange: Self-Destruct Mode (original Omnitrix form)/Alien Creation (Reconfigured Omnitrix form)
**Grey: Inactive Mode
**Pink: Under [[Spells (Classic)|spell]] effect
**White: Transformed (original Omnitrix form)

===Display Modes===
*The Omnitrix had two known display modes.
**During the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' flashbacks, it was black silhouettes of the aliens.
**After reconfiguration, it was changed to dark green holograms of the aliens.
***Orange if it's an alien species created from the Omnitrix.<ref name="AS"/>
****The Omnitrix could rotate the holograms 360 degrees.<ref name="TFB2"/>
*{{Cite|By changing the settings on the Omnitrix, either of the above display modes could have been used with the Omnitrix in either of its forms.}}

===Clothing===
*Prior to its reconfiguration, the Omnitrix automatically used the molecules of its wearer's clothes to create coverings for the aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Clothes.png]]|group=pop-up}}<ref name="ATTWT"/> This function was lost when the Omnitrix reconfigured; instead, nanomachines broke its wearer's clothes down and stored them until the transformation ended.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben's Clothes During Transformations.PNG]]|group=DM}}
**Most of the aliens appeared naked in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' due to a bug.{{Refn|[[:File:Old Omnitrix Glitches.png]]|group=DJW|name=glitches}}

===Allocation===
*Although the Omnitrix was in the center of the chest area on every alien in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' is for easy access, it was put in different places on some aliens in the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' flashbacks.
**The limited positioning of the symbols in '''Alien Force''' was the result of a glitch of the Omnitrix.{{Refn|group=DJW|name=glitches}}

===Voice Command===
*The Omnitrix could be controlled by voice, called Voice Command. 
**'''Omnitrix Command Function Override:''' Overrides function.<ref name="TFB1"/>
**'''Omnitrix Revert/Repair''' '''(species name)<ref name="WotW1"/>'''
**'''Omnitrix Voicecommand Mode'''<ref name="TFB1"/>
**'''Access Master Control''': Unlocks the Master Control but only works to Azmuth's voice.<ref name="WotW1"/>
**'''Decouple Omnitrix Command Code: 000 - Release Coupling - 0''': Removes the Omnitrix.<ref name="TFB1"/>
**'''Omnitrix Self-Destruct in (time): Command code: 000 - Destruct - 0''': Activates Self-Destruct Mode.<ref name="TFB2"/>

===Codes===
*The Omnitrix has thousands of code combinations for various purposes,{{Refn|[[:File:The Visitor Pop-up (23).png]]|group=pop-up}}<ref name="TV">''[[The Visitor]]''</ref> such as:
**Unlock DNA samples.<ref name="TV"/>
**Unlock functions such as Master Control.<ref name="BWaV"/>
**How to also block functions.<ref name="BWaV"/>

