{{Quote|[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|You've]] overloaded the thing so badly I could sense it half a galaxy away. Those non-stop transformations are gonna break it.|[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]], explaining the dangers of overusing the quick-change feature.<ref name="GCBC">''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''</ref>}}
*During the '''Original Series''' and the '''Omniverse''' flashbacks, the Omnitrix would sometimes transform the user into the wrong alien. 
**This malfunction was fixed after the Omnitrix reconfigured, but came back after it was damaged by Kevin's [[Hacking Machine]].<ref name="VoV2"/>
**This malfunction also occurs within the [[Race Against Time Timeline|'''Race Against Time''' Timeline]]'s Omnitrix.<ref name="RAT"/>
*If the Omnitrix's faceplate cover is broken off, the result was DNA [[Combinations (Classic)|combinations]].<ref name=":0"/>
*The Omnitrix could be affected by electromagnetic waves, which ultimately activated the self-destruct mode.<ref name="SotO"/>
*When exposed to electromagnetic interference, the Omnitrix could cause unintentional transformations and will be unable to deactivate until the source of the interference is gone.<ref name="CoR">''[[Con of Rath]]''</ref>
**This could work in reverse, rapidly changing the user from one form to another until someone/something stops it.
*If the user gets sick, the Omnitrix would make the aliens sick too.<ref name="SE">''[[Side Effects]]''</ref><ref name="TSC">''[[The Secret of Chromastone]]''</ref>
**In the pre-reconfigurated form, the aliens would get badly affected by the cold and weaker than normal.
**In the reconfigurated form, the aliens would only get weaker than normal.
*During the '''Original Series''' and '''Omniverse''' flashbacks, the Omnitrix gave some aliens unnecessary clothes.
**After reconfiguration, technical glitches that would leave all the aliens naked and cold.
***Azmuth reformatted and corrected these errors in the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|new Omnitrix]].{{Refn|group=DJW|name=glitches}}
*If the user is transformed in [[Ditto]], he will not be able to return to normal if his clones are far from each other.<ref name="DWS">''[[Divided We Stand]]''</ref>
**If this occurs, the time for other transformations will be shorter as they require a lot of energy from the Omnitrix.
*If hacked by [[Eon]], the Omnitrix will transform the user into a [[Eon (Transformation)|younger version]] of himself,<ref name="RAT">'''''[[Ben 10: Race Against Time]]'''''</ref>{{Refn|The [[Chronian]] transformation is non-canon as of ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'' due to '''''Race Against Time''''' being retconned as an [[Race Against Time Timeline|alternate timeline]] and [[Eon]]'s backstory being revised into an alternate version of Ben.{{Refn|[[Contradictory Retcons (Classic)|Contradictory Retcons]]|name=retcon|group=BTP}}|group=note|name=eon}} it can also switch the user's mind with an older version of themselves.<ref name="BA"/>
*Aliens like [[Ghostfreak]] can escape the Omnitrix via sentinence.<ref name="GhO"/> But others like [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]], [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]], [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], and [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]] can escape via hacking.<ref name="VoV2"/>
*In addition to gaining all the powers and abilities of an alien, the user gains all the weaknesses of that alien as well. The user is also susceptible to certain behaviors inherent to the alien he/she is transformed into, such as [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]]'s reproductive nature.<ref>''[[Save the Last Dance]]''</ref>
*The genetics of some species can alter the user's personality, as occurs with [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]].<ref name="CoR"/>{{Refn|[[:File:Aliens' genetics affect Ben's personality.png]]|group=CM}}
*Sometimes the Omnitrix would randomly leave the user stuck as an alien for an indefinite amount of time<ref name="ASP"/> that could only be deactivated by Azmuth hitting the Omnitrix symbol.<ref name="TH">''[[Trouble Helix]]''</ref>
*Powerful items like [[Vilgax's Sword]] are capable of forcing a time out on the Omnitrix.<ref name="Primus"/>
*The Omnitrix has no mind control protection.<ref name="MM">''[[Midnight Madness]]''</ref>
*After the Omnitrix reconfigured, any damage the user sustains was retained when said user times out.<ref>[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]</ref><ref>''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 2]]''</ref>
*Non-stop transformations could overload the Omnitrix and cause it to break.<ref name="Azmuth">[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]</ref><ref name="GCBC"/>
*The Omnitrix's user and its transformations where vulnerable to being de-aged.<ref>''[[Don't Drink the Water]]''</ref>
*If the user activates a beam to revert [[DNAlien]]s back to humans, the Omnitrix's energy would deplete and the user would get exhausted, turning the device into the recharge mode.<ref name="WotW1">''[[War of the Worlds: Part 1]]''</ref>
*An overload of [[Manna]], or [[Magic (Classic)|magic]] in general, could cause the Omnitrix to heavily malfunction.<ref name="DAA">'''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]'''''</ref>
**In fact, some unexplained malfunctions that the Omnitrix had during the '''Original Series''' were due to interference with [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen's]] magical powers.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group=AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}
*If the Omnitrix is scratched, it will slowly transform the user.<ref name="Benwolf">''[[Benwolf]]''</ref>
*If the Omnitrix is creating an alien species, it will not allow the user to transform and only show half formed shapes instead of full holographic alien forms.<ref name="AS"/>
*When an alien species is finished being created by the Omnitrix, the hologram would remain in an orange and static like state instead of green.<ref name="AS"/> 
**This malfunction would later be fixed when transferred into the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] and new Omnitrix.
*Certain transformations may develop a link if unlocked through others, as happened with [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]] and [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]],{{Refn|group=AF Mini Bible|name = bible}} which will prevent the user from using one of them.<ref name="TSC"/>
*The Omnitrix could be temporarily disrupted by the teleportation feedback such as from the [[Purple Lightning|purple lightning]].<ref name="Benwolf"/>
*The DNA sources of aliens can override the alien and take control of the user's mind, like [[Ghostfreak]]<ref name="GhO"/><ref name="GhT">''[[Ghost Town]]''</ref> and [[Eon (Transformation)|Eon]].<ref name="RAT"/>
*The Omnitrix can be hacked by [[Galvanic Mechamorph (Classic)|Galvanic Mechamorphs]].<ref name="DAA"/><ref name="S1"/> Also, the aliens can be eradicaded by Mechamorph hacking.<ref name="S1"/>
*Overusing the Omnitrix will permanently disfigure the user's DNA.<ref name="BWaV"/><ref name="S1"/>
*In [[Sumo Slammer Smackdown]], the Omnitrix is limited to only giving the user access to icon aliens he has collected.<ref name="GO">''[[Game Over]]''</ref>

